<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOCCER-LEADING GOALSCORERS IN AFRICAN WORLD CUP QUALIFIERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING GOALSCORERS IN AFRICAN WORLD CUP QUALIFIERS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in</p>
<p>African World Cup qualifiers after matches played at the</p>
<p>weekend:</p>
<p>5 - Paulao (Angola), Adel Sellimi (Tunisia), Vitalis Takawira</p>
<p>(Zimbabwe)</p>
<p>4 - Mamadou Zongo (Burkina Faso), Hossam Hassan (Egypt),</p>
<p>Aboubacar Titi Camara, Momo Wandel Soumah (Guinea), Mike Okoth</p>
<p>(Kenya), Daniel Amokachi (Nigeria), Phil Masinga (South Africa)</p>
<p>3 - Akwa (Angola), Patrick Mboma, Alphonse Tchami (Cameroon),</p>
<p>Aly Maher (Egypt), Fode Camara (Guinea), Zoubier Beya (Tunisia)</p>
</text>
